# Gitignored files Claude Code copies into every worktree it creates (gitignore syntax;
# only paths that are ALSO gitignored are copied). An agent's worktree is a fresh checkout:
# without these it has no database to talk to and the API refuses to boot.
# Names only — nothing in this file is a secret, and nothing listed here is ever committed.
apps/api/.env
apps/web/.env
apps/web/.env.local
packages/database/.env
